Title:  Aspirations for glory

Seq:    12.6.111.1.3

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Morris, Michael|Michael Morris]], 2024, from the book *[[Tribal: How the Cultural Instincts That Divide Us Can Help Bring Us Together]]*

Timestamp: 20251116184920

Date Added: 2025-11-16 11:49:20 -0700

Date Modified: 2026-10-15 12:27:06 -0600

Body:

Our upward-directed fascination with celebrities, CEOs, MVPs, and other elites comes from the hero instinct, as do our aspirations for glory and our drive to contribute.

